{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026LEgfphYFjC1795337868.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中國石油天然氣集團副總經理謝軍，涉嫌嚴重違紀違法，被中紀委國家監委審查調查。</p><p></p><p>中央紀委國家監委網站公布相關消息。資料顯示，58歲的謝軍2022年1月起，擔任中國石油天然氣集團副總經理，同年6月被聘任為中石油公司董事。今次是他在任期間被查。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.OFFICIAL-1500.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026VjzVfL3XxS1795337928.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T09:43:51.704623+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":119,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T08:39:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T17:37:38.706082+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T09:37:15.814897+00:00","content_hash":"ddc6d0b9c99f3d8ce900a5416af38d84ba183c4c9c5ce9c8968a83383abd6da6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}